WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.460
"Grr!" Roxy tried to break free.

2
00:00:06.461 --> 00:00:09.792
But the lasso got tighter.

3
00:00:09.793 --> 00:00:11.824
Stinky Bart laughed.

4
00:00:11.825 --> 00:00:14.708
"You'll never get out of my lasso!

5
00:00:14.709 --> 00:00:17.083
It's super strong!"

6
00:00:17.084 --> 00:00:22.287
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams at the rope.

7
00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:24.970
The laser beams bounced right off.

8
00:00:24.971 --> 00:00:27.722
"Ugh!" said Roxy.

9
00:00:27.723 --> 00:00:30.267
Stinky Bart laughed again.

10
00:00:30.268 --> 00:00:34.081
"I'll try my heat vision!" thought Roxy.

11
00:00:34.082 --> 00:00:36.379
She stared at the lasso.

12
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:40.852
An orange beam radiated from her eyes.

13
00:00:40.853 --> 00:00:43.919
But the rope didn't burn at all.

14
00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.449
Stinky Bart laughed again.

15
00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.331
"Just give up, Rocket Girl!"

16
00:00:49.332 --> 00:00:53.478
The pretzel man called out, "Fly, Rocket Girl!

17
00:00:53.479 --> 00:00:55.799
The lasso might be stronger than you.

18
00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.011
But Stinky Bart isn't!"

19
00:00:58.012 --> 00:01:00.816
Roxy's eyes lit up.

20
00:01:00.817 --> 00:01:05.383
She shot into the air.

21
00:01:05.384 --> 00:01:08.407
Stinky Bart tried to hold on to the lasso.

22
00:01:08.408 --> 00:01:10.693
But it was ripped from his hands.

23
00:01:10.694 --> 00:01:14.802
"No!" cried the cowboy.

24
00:01:14.803 --> 00:01:18.963
Roxy spotted an antenna on top of a skyscraper.

25
00:01:18.964 --> 00:01:21.804
"Perfect!" said Roxy.

26
00:01:21.805 --> 00:01:25.322
She flew over the antenna and then dropped down.

27
00:01:25.323 --> 00:01:29.414
The antenna poked through the knot in the lasso.

28
00:01:29.415 --> 00:01:32.350
Roxy pulled, and the knot came loose.

29
00:01:32.351 --> 00:01:36.511
"Yes!" Roxy cheered.

30
00:01:36.512 --> 00:01:39.622
She took the lasso and flew back down to the street.

31
00:01:39.623 --> 00:01:42.662
Stinky Bart was trying to reach his horse.

32
00:01:42.663 --> 00:01:45.148
But people were blocking his way.

33
00:01:45.149 --> 00:01:50.557
"You're not going to escape, you smelly cowboy!" shouted the pretzel man.

34
00:01:50.558 --> 00:01:56.027
"Yes, I am!" shouted Stinky Bart.

35
00:01:56.028 --> 00:01:59.878
"Stop right there, Stinky Bart!" cried Roxy.

36
00:01:59.879 --> 00:02:02.219
"You're going to jail!"

37
00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:05.160
Roxy swung the lasso over her head.

38
00:02:05.161 --> 00:02:08.702
Shwoosh! She threw it at the cowboy.

39
00:02:08.703 --> 00:02:12.204
Stinky Bart quickly jumped. Boing!

40
00:02:12.205 --> 00:02:15.528
He bounced and landed on top of a parked bus.

41
00:02:15.529 --> 00:02:21.811
"I've got bouncy cowboy boots!" Stinky Bart laughed.

42
00:02:21.812 --> 00:02:25.700
Roxy started swinging the lasso over her head again.

43
00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:30.664
Boing! Stinky Bart bounced off the bus and toward a big truck.

44
00:02:30.665 --> 00:02:32.900
Roxy threw the lasso.

45
00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:37.229
Shwoosh! It snagged Stinky Bart's leg.

46
00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:39.540
"No!" he cried.

47
00:02:39.541 --> 00:02:42.278
Stinky Bart fell to the street.

48
00:02:42.279 --> 00:02:46.214
Roxy quickly tied him up.

49
00:02:46.215 --> 00:02:49.090
Detective Smith ran over.

50
00:02:49.091 --> 00:02:51.561
"Well done, Rocket Girl!"

51
00:02:51.562 --> 00:02:54.488
"Thanks, Detective," said Roxy.

52
00:02:54.489 --> 00:02:57.043
"You can take him to jail now.

53
00:02:57.044 --> 00:03:01.817
And make sure he gets a shower—he stinks!"

54
00:03:01.818 --> 00:03:05.252
Roxy hurried over to the pretzel stand.

55
00:03:05.253 --> 00:03:10.255
"One pretzel, please."

56
00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:13.744
Roxy got back to the arena and found her friends.

57
00:03:13.745 --> 00:03:17.203
"Sorry that took so long," she said.

58
00:03:17.204 --> 00:03:19.667
Roxy handed out the snacks.

59
00:03:19.668 --> 00:03:23.313
"Thanks for the pretzel, Roxy," said Terrell.

60
00:03:23.314 --> 00:03:25.872
"No problem," said Roxy.

61
00:03:25.873 --> 00:03:28.621
"Rocket Girl helped me get it."

62
00:03:28.622 --> 00:03:31.317
Terrell eyed her suspiciously.

63
00:03:31.318 --> 00:03:33.731
"You're kidding, right?"

64
00:03:33.732 --> 00:03:40.580
"Yep," said Roxy.

